{"articleNo":"101875","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=101875&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2014 이집트 정부초청 장학생 선발 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2014.02.28","hit":"2600","attachments":[{"name":"이집트 정부초청 장학생.zip","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=101875&attachNo=72364"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment--><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">이집트정부에서는 아랍어 전공 희망 학부생을 아래와 같이 장학생으로 초청코자 하오니, 관심있는 학생들의 참여 바랍니다. </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY헤드라인M; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HY헤드라인M; mso-fareast-font-family: HY헤드라인M\" lang=\"EN-US\">2014 이집트정부초청 장학생 선발 요강 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">1. 선발과정, 분야 및 인원 : 아랍어 학부과정, 11명</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">※추천 인원을 이집트 교육부에서 11개 대학에 배치함.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. 장학 조건</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">□ 장학기간: 4~5년 (2014.9월 입학)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">□ 학비면제</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">□ 항공료 및 숙식비 등 제반 경비 본인 부담</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">※숙식비는 월 30~50만원 예상</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">3. 지원 자격</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">□ 대한민국 국적자</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">□ 고등학교 졸업자 (졸업후 3년 이내)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">※ 병역법 및 해외유학에 결격 사유가 없는 자</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">4. 선발 방법: 고등학교 성적</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">(100점)으로 선발하며, 11명 이상 지원시 주한 이집트 대 사관에서 영어 면접 실시 (4. 16, 수요일 예정, 일시 개별 통보)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">5. 제출 서류 및 기타 사항: 별첨1 참조</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">붙임 : 1.이집트정부초청장학생 모집 요강 1부</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">붙임 : 2.지원서A (국립국제교육원 소정양식) 1부 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">붙임 : 3.2014이집트 장학생 지원서B 및 신체검사서 1부</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
